# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# NOTE: App/App/public, App/App/capacitor.config.json and App/App/config.xml are
# intentionally tracked (not ignored) so the repo is clone-and-build with only
# Xcode — they are required inputs of the app's Resources build phase. To refresh
# the web bundle after game changes, re-run `npx cap sync ios` and commit public/.
